		(at 23.45 12.019829)
		(descr "CLASS C [EYEBALLED, measured:false] A position found BY LOOKING at a native-resolution tile (M09) and never by a detector. The handoff carries position_eyeballed_mm, measured:false and do_not_draw_as_measured:true, and all three are honoured here. Accurate to about a millimetre. It is on the board so that the board is KNOWINGLY incomplete rather than looking complete -- a miss written down is a different object from a miss not written down.")
